# JVM arguments for trenching-bot.service (java @/opt/trenching-bot/jvm.options).
#
# Oracle can reclaim an idle Always Free instance when CPU, network and memory
# all stay under 20 % for 7 days. Starting at 3 GB and pre-touching the heap keeps
# resident memory above 20 % of this 12 GB VM, whatever the load.
-Xms3g
-Xmx4g
-XX:+AlwaysPreTouch
-XX:+ExitOnOutOfMemoryError
-Duser.timezone=UTC
